{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift to earn score which will get you money so that you can expand your collection of unique owned vehicles to drift around with each one having it's own feel in single-player game-modes or with friends on a free-roam map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100%</strong> <strong>Free multiplayer</strong> with multi-region server support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Cars</strong> to purchase with in-game currency &amp; drift with some customization options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way to the top of our <strong>several leader-boards</strong> to show everyone your drifting skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift around with a <strong>custom playlist</strong> in our endless or highway mode with chaotic traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap your sky-box</strong> while drifting to instantly change up the vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply a <strong>VHS or Pixel effect</strong> to get a nice retro feel!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more fun to be had all for the price of nothing : )</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Super Jump: Hold 'L SHIFT' to activate slo-motion then hold 'SPACE' or 'F' to super jump ;) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Flip Mid-Air: While high up in the air. Hold S to bring speed below 50 then hold 'E' to start flipping </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Playlists</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, there is a custom playlist feature that allows you to drift to any playlist you want while watching the visual wave-forms of the song move around you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This feature works with .WAV only.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Solid Drifter","path":"